      "proposed_fix_type": "new_door_rfc",
      "source_anchor": "Aurabot's identity is a party-support buff-projector — zero personal damage, output = ALLIES' amplified power — and it is explicitly useless solo. The engine is solo-scope, so the kit's entire purpose has no lane: there are no allies to buff. Additionally the ~100% reservation exceeds the engine's 0.75 LOCKED reservation cap. Mapped the aura shell + clamped reserve, but a player of the original would find the build does literally nothing in solo — the ally-projection that IS the kit cannot be expressed. Docketed as out-of-solo-scope."
    }
  ],
