    "mech_note": "A support build that reserves the entire mana pool (and sometimes life via Blood Magic) to project auras onto ALLIES — zero personal damage, 100% multiplier to party output. Core auras: Hatred (added cold damage), Wrath (lightning), Anger (fire), Malevolence (DoT), Determination (armour), Grace (evasion), Haste (speed), Clarity (mana regen). Aurasbot's damage contribution is multiplicative: if the party DPS player does 10M DPS, a 20% aura damage buff is 2M DPS added via zero button presses. Generosity support gem shares aura effects to allies only (not self). The build requires specific passive clusters (reduced reserve nodes, reservation efficiency items) to fit 8+ auras simultaneously. Strictly multiplayer: useless solo. Represents PoE's most extreme support-class expression — the player is a walking buff-station.",
